{"id":"cc79bf567b8e7dc8","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/644_Halpern–Shoham_区间逻辑_HS.md","title":"644 Halpern–Shoham 区间逻辑 HS","display":"644_Halpern–Shoham_区间逻辑_HS","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>HS 关系标签集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HSRel}=\\{Eq,A,\\bar A,B,\\bar B,E,\\bar E,D,\\bar D,L,\\bar L,O,\\bar O\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{HSRel}=\\{Eq,A,\\bar A,B,\\bar B,E,\\bar E,D,\\bar D,L,\\bar L,O,\\bar O\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dia}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{dia}_R\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel}\\)</span>。显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R\\rangle A\">\\(\\langle R\\rangle A\\)</span>，派生 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[R]A=\\neg\\langle R\\rangle\\neg A\">\\([R]A=\\neg\\langle R\\rangle\\neg A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R\\rangle A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\langle R\\rangle A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{644}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{644}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{644}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{644}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{644}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为常空函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{644}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{644}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span> 成立。HS 语言没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>对函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span> 定义支撑：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{644}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{644}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{644}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{644}\\)</span> 为所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{644}(\\sigma)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}_{644}(\\sigma)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\\)</span> 的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{644}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span> 的集合。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PSub}_{644}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{644}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PSub}_{644}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{644}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PSub}_{644}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{PSub}_{644}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>。扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\langle R\\rangle\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\langle R\\rangle\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,644}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,644}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{644}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{644}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{644}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{644}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{644}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{644}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反演函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}:\\mathsf{HSRel}\\to\\mathsf{HSRel}\">\\(\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}:\\mathsf{HSRel}\\to\\mathsf{HSRel}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(Eq)=Eq,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(Eq)=Eq,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(A)=\\bar A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar A)=A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(A)=\\bar A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar A)=A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(B)=\\bar B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar B)=B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(B)=\\bar B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar B)=B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(E)=\\bar E,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar E)=E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(E)=\\bar E,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar E)=E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(D)=\\bar D,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar D)=D,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(D)=\\bar D,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar D)=D,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(L)=\\bar L,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar L)=L,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(L)=\\bar L,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar L)=L,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(O)=\\bar O,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar O)=O.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(O)=\\bar O,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(\\bar O)=O.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>HS 模态公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{644}=\\{[R](A\\to B)\\to([R]A\\to[R]B):R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{644}=\\{[R](A\\to B)\\to([R]A\\to[R]B):R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{644}=\\{A\\to[R]\\langle\\bar R\\rangle A:R,\\bar R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel},\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(R)=\\bar R,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{644}=\\{A\\to[R]\\langle\\bar R\\rangle A:R,\\bar R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel},\\operatorname{Inv}_{644}(R)=\\bar R,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{644}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{644}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{644}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{644}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{644}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{644}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模态必然化规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A}{[R]A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A}{[R]A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{644}=\\{((A),[R]A):R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{644}=\\{((A),[R]A):R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{644}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{644}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{644}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{644}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{644}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{644}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{644})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}^{\\,m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{644}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{644})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}^{\\,m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{644}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{644}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{644}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{644}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{HSRel}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{644}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{644}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{644}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{644}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{644}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{644}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{644}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{644}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>HS 的目标差异是十二个非平凡 Allen/Halpern–Shoham 区间关系与身份关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Eq\">\\(Eq\\)</span>，共十三个原始模态索引，并由本地反演函数约束。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-区间骨架\">10. 区间骨架</h1>\n<p>定义自然数上的有界区间集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Int}_{644}=\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N:i&lt;j\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Int}_{644}=\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N:i&lt;j\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=(i,j)\">\\(I=(i,j)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=(k,l)\">\\(J=(k,l)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}\\subseteq \\mathsf{HSRel}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}\\subseteq \\mathsf{HSRel}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(Eq,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow I=J,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(Eq,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow I=J,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(A,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j=k,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(A,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j=k,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar A,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow l=i,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar A,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow l=i,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(B,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i=k\\land l&lt;j,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(B,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i=k\\land l&lt;j,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar B,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i=k\\land j&lt;l,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar B,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i=k\\land j&lt;l,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(E,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j=l\\land i&lt;k,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(E,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j=l\\land i&lt;k,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar E,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j=l\\land k&lt;i,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar E,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j=l\\land k&lt;i,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(D,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;k\\land l&lt;j,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(D,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;k\\land l&lt;j,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar D,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow k&lt;i\\land j&lt;l,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar D,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow k&lt;i\\land j&lt;l,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(L,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j&lt;k,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(L,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow j&lt;k,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar L,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow l&lt;i,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar L,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow l&lt;i,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(O,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;k\\land k&lt;j\\land j&lt;l,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(O,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;k\\land k&lt;j\\land j&lt;l,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar O,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow k&lt;i\\land i&lt;l\\land l&lt;j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(\\bar O,I,J)\\Longleftrightarrow k&lt;i\\land i&lt;l\\land l&lt;j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-区间满足与语义后果\">11. 区间满足与语义后果</h1>\n<p>定义 HS 区间赋值集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valn}_{644}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valn}_{644}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{644}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Valn}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{644}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Valn}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,I\\not\\Vdash_{644}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,I\\not\\Vdash_{644}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,I\\not\\Vdash_{644}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,I\\not\\Vdash_{644}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,I\\not\\Vdash_{644}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,I\\not\\Vdash_{644}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}\\langle R\\rangle A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(R,I,J)\\land\\nu,J\\Vdash_{644}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}\\langle R\\rangle A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{HSR}_{644}(R,I,J)\\land\\nu,J\\Vdash_{644}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{644}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{644}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valn}_{644}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Valn}_{644}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{644}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,I\\Vdash_{644}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SVal}_{644}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}:\\varnothing\\models_{644}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SVal}_{644}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{644}:\\varnothing\\models_{644}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-整个句法与区间语义形式系统\">12. 整个句法与区间语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{HS}_{644}=(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644},\\mathsf{HSRel},\\operatorname{Inv}_{644},\\mathsf{Frm}_{644},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{644},\\operatorname{BV}_{644},\\mathsf{Subst}_{644},\\operatorname{PSub}_{644},\\equiv_{\\alpha,644},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{644},\\mathsf{Rule}_{644},\\mathsf{Proof}_{644},\\vdash_{644},\\mathsf{Thm}_{644},\n\\mathsf{Int}_{644},\\operatorname{HSR}_{644},\\mathsf{Valn}_{644},\\Vdash_{644},\\models_{644},\\mathsf{SVal}_{644}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{HS}_{644}=(\\mathsf{Prop}_{644},\\mathsf{HSRel},\\operatorname{Inv}_{644},\\mathsf{Frm}_{644},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{644},\\operatorname{BV}_{644},\\mathsf{Subst}_{644},\\operatorname{PSub}_{644},\\equiv_{\\alpha,644},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{644},\\mathsf{Rule}_{644},\\mathsf{Proof}_{644},\\vdash_{644},\\mathsf{Thm}_{644},\n\\mathsf{Int}_{644},\\operatorname{HSR}_{644},\\mathsf{Valn}_{644},\\Vdash_{644},\\models_{644},\\mathsf{SVal}_{644}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 HS 区间模态句法、公理、证明关系和自然数区间上的本地满足关系；不含完备性证明、判定过程或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","l